eel a draft!', bats 'Bats nearby!'"$LL]"BEHACJBDLCENADFEGOFHQAGIHJRBIKJLSCKMLNTDMOFNPOQTGPRIQSKRTMPS"t!12_o!6_q!0r!"/{HUNT THE WUMPUS"$LL"Instructions? (y//n) "$KQ121=(I0)110c!1(c@121=0=(B0)OL"Hunt the Wumpus!"$L1(LG"You are in room "$0P#L"Tunnels lead to "$0P0T#" "$0P1T#" "$0P2T#L"Shoot or move (s-m)? "$0?Q:c!115=(F0)c@109=(V0)g@0=)g@0>("Hee hee hee - the Wumpus'll getcha next time!!"$L0)g@0<("Ha ha ha - you lose!"$L0)1(L"Same cave (y), new cave (n) or quit (q)? "$0?Q:c!121=c@110=|c@113=|0=)c@113=0=)"Bye."$L